# VHS tape configuration for first5 demo recording
# Install VHS: https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs

Output assets/demo.gif

Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 680
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "TokyoNight"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "first5"
Sleep 500ms
Enter

Sleep 1.5s
Down 1
Sleep 800ms
Down 1
Sleep 800ms
Up 1
Sleep 1s
Enter

Sleep 3s
